@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
package "Android" {
 [Kotlin UI / lifecycle] as UI
 [UniFFI bridge] as Bridge
}
package "Shared Rust runtime" {
 [Node core / scheduler] as Core
 [Privacy policy gate] as Gate
 [SQLite adapter] as DB
 [libp2p adapter] as Net
}
[ExecuTorch local backend] as ET
[Approved private backend
NOT SELECTED] as PB
[Desktop CLI] as CLI
[Remote nodes] as Peer
UI --> Bridge
Bridge --> Core
CLI --> Core
Core --> DB
Core --> ET
Core --> Gate
Gate --> PB : only approved profiles
PB --> Net : protocol adapter required
Net <--> Peer
note bottom of Gate
No approved profile => reject remote private AI.
Secure transport alone is insufficient.
end note
@enduml
